      "value": "<p>Whenever you cast a Wizard spell from the Evocation school, you can add your Intelligence modifier to one damage roll of that spell.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-3cdT0RlurgG5XV4o\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>You can add your Intelligence modifier to the spell's Situational Bonus in the damage dialog or use this feature's <strong>Damage</strong> activity which allows you to select the type in the damage dialog.</p></section><p><em>Automation (midi-qol entries):</em> your Intelligence modifier is added to the first damage roll of your wizard evocation spells.</p>",
